{title: 429 - Jerusalem the Golden}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #429 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 429}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C/E]Jerusalem the [Dm/F]golden,
[C/G]With [Em]milk [Am]and [G#m]honey [Am]blest,
[Am/C]Beneath [C/G]thy [C#m/G#]contemplation
[C/G]Sink [Am]heart [C/G]and [G]voice [C/E]oppressed.
[G]I [Dm/A]know [C/G]not, [Am]O [G#m]I [Am]know [Bdim]not
[Em/B]What [C]holy joys [Dm/A]are [C]there;
[Dm]What [C]radiancy [Em]of [C/E]glory,
[C/G]What [Am]bliss [C/G]beyond [G]compare.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C/E]They [Dm/F]stand, [C/E]those [Dm/A]hall [C/G]of [Dm/F]Zion,
[C/G]All [Em]jubilant [G#m/B]with [Am]song,
[Am/C]And bright [C]with many [E7]an [C/E]angel,
[C/G]And [Am]all [C/G]the [G]martyr throng.
[G]The [Dm/A]Prince [C/G]is [Am]ever in [Bdim]them,
[Em/B]The [C]daylight is [Dm/A]serene;
[Dm]The [C]pastures [Em]of [C/E]the [G7]blessed
[C/G]Are [Am]deck [C/G]in [G]glorious [C/E]sheen.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C/E]There [Dm/F]is [C/E]the [Dm/A]throne [C/G]of [Dm/F]David,
[C/G]And [Em]there, [Am]from [G#m]care released,
[Am/C]The [C]shout of [C#m/G#]them [E7]that [C/E]triumph,
[C/G]The [Am]song [C/G]of [G]them [C/E]that [G]feast;
[G]And [Dm/A]they [C/G]who, [Am]with [G#m]their [Am]Leader,
[Em/B]Have [C]conquered in [Dm/A]the [C]fight,
[Dm]Forever [Em]and forever
[C/G]Are clad [Am]in [C/G]robes [Em]of [C/E]white.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C/E]O [Dm/F]sweet [C/E]and [Dm/A]blessed [C/G]country,
[C/G]The [Em]home [Am]of [G#m]God's elect!
[Am/C]O [C]sweet and [C#m/G#]blessed [E7]country,
[C/G]That [Am]eager [G]hearts [C/E]expect!
[G]Jesus, [C/G]in [Am]mercy bring [Bdim]us
[Em/B]To [C]that dear land [Dm/A]of [C]rest;
[Dm]Who [C]art, with [Em]God the [C/E]Father,
[C/G]And [Am]Spirit, [G]ever [C/E]blest.
{end_of_verse}
